title: Remote Execution Named Pipe over SMB
id: 96c4a8e5-bfbc-4117-a792-9c78a7322299
status: experimental
description: Detects SMB access to named pipes used by remote-execution frameworks (svcctl, atsvc, psexecsvc, paexec) from a workstation, indicating PsExec-style lateral movement over the network.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/002/
logsource:
  category: network_connection
detection:
  selection:
    protocol: 'smb'
    named_pipe:
      - 'svcctl'
      - 'atsvc'
      - 'psexecsvc'
      - 'paexec'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - named_pipe
falsepositives:
  - Administrative remote management
level: high
tags:
  - attack.lateral_movement
  - attack.t1021.002
